  "system": {
    "source": {
      "custom": "",
      "book": "RAINTDM",
      "page": "",
      "license": "",
      "rules": "2024",
      "revision": 1
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "<h3>Features</h3><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #c0c0c0;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#c0c0c0\">Mastery (Nick)</strong></p><p>When you make the extra attack of the Light property, you can make it as part of the Attack action instead of taking a Bonus Action.</p></div><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #1eff00;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#1eff00\">Shield Bash</strong></p><p>You learn to seamlessly weave your shield into your attack forms. While equipped, the shield functions as a Martial Melee weapon that deals [[/r 1d4]] Bludgeoning damage and has the Light property.</p></div><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #1eff00;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#1eff00\">Item Prodigy</strong></p><p><strong>Bonus Action.</strong></p><p>The hallmark of the weapon. You can take the Utilize action (such as drinking a potion, throwing alchemist's fire, or setting a trap) as a Bonus Action. You can do this even while holding both the sword and the shield.</p></div><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #0070dd;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#0070dd\">Alchemical Rend</strong></p><p>You use your rapid strikes to create openings for your items and spells. When you hit a creature with this weapon, that creature has Disadvantage on the next saving throw it makes against an item (like a bomb, poison, or caltrops) or a spell before the end of your next turn.</p></div><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #0070dd;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#0070dd\">Advancing Slash</strong></p><p>Your mobility in combat increases. When you use your Item Prodigy feature to take the Utilize action, you can immediately move up to 10 feet without provoking Opportunity Attacks.</p></div><p><em>Bonuses:</em> +1 to attack and damage rolls. Integrated shield +2 AC, plus +1 AC from rarity (total +3 AC while equipped).</p>",
      "chat": "<div style=\"margin:0.4em 0;padding:0.35em 0.55em;border-left:3px solid #c0c0c0;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#c0c0c0\">Mastery (Nick)</strong></p></div><div style=\"margin:0.4em 0;padding:0.35em 0.55em;border-left:3px solid #1eff00;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#1eff00\">Shield Bash</strong></p></div><div style=\"margin:0.4em 0;padding:0.35em 0.55em;border-left:3px solid #1eff00;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#1eff00\">Item Prodigy</strong></p><p><strong>Bonus Action.</strong></p></div><div style=\"margin:0.4em 0;padding:0.35em 0.55em;border-left:3px solid #0070dd;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#0070dd\">Alchemical Rend</strong></p></div><div style=\"margin:0.4em 0;padding:0.35em 0.55em;border-left:3px solid #0070dd;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#0070dd\">Advancing Slash</strong></p></div>"
    },
